@startuml cu71
!theme plain
title CU71 — Seguridad, Privacidad y Cumplimiento

actor "Security officer (Oficial de Seguridad)" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The user enters their credentials.
System -> System : User
Actor -> Actor : Validates the credentials against the secure hash.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : If they are valid, generates a session with a signed token.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : Sends the token over HTTPS/TLS.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The user requests to run an operation.
System -> System : User
Actor -> Actor : Validates the role permissions.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : Authorizes the execution.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : Records the action in the audit log.
System -> System : System

@enduml